imestamp": "00:07:52", "text": "告訴他們：「是的，我現在在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 474.869, "timestamp": "00:07:54", "text": "新宿。」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 477.43, "timestamp": "00:07:57", "text": "夥計，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 489.67, "timestamp": "00:08:09", "text": "讓我現在就去做。  嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 499.11, "timestamp": "00:08:19", "text": "我不知道自己要去哪裡。我想去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 502.07, "timestamp": "00:08:22", "text": "一些地方看看。呃，那裡有個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.23, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "國家公園，但要付500美元"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 506.95, "timestamp": "00:08:26", "text": "。我身上沒帶現金。我可以用現金，但我不想這麼做。我當時就想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 630.47, "timestamp": "00:10:30", "text": "我現在是直播狀態嗎？我還活著嗎？我還活著嗎？  我回來了嗎？我回來了嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 640.31, "timestamp": "00:10:40", "text": "？請告訴我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.67, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "今天發生了什麼事。  就像昨天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 646.31, "timestamp": "00:10:46", "text": "在東京的直播一樣，非常順利。  那麼今天發生了什麼事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 653.35, "timestamp": "00:10:53", "text": "？新宿為什麼這麼讓人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 656.87, "timestamp": "00:10:56", "text": "痛苦？今天我的包包好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 659.19, "timestamp": "00:10:59", "text": "重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 662.389, "timestamp": "00:11:02", "text": "我昨天待在網咖。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 664.63, "timestamp": "00:11:04", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 669.75, "timestamp": "00:11:09", "text": "我醒來後一切都煥然一新。我搞砸了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 675.99, "timestamp": "00:11:15", "text": "我現在要說的是，當你查看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 678.63, "timestamp": "00:11:18", "text": "谷歌地圖時，會看到一些贊助"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 683.19, "timestamp": "00:11:23", "text": "廣告之類的東西，還有我之前想去的那所學校——三國中學"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 687.43, "timestamp": "00:11:27", "text": "。它明明在新宿，但我去的時候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 693.35, "timestamp": "00:11:33", "text": "我"}, {"type": "su